oxa
===
W0-FROZEN (architect-owned). Extend the list below when a task ports a further pi file.

oxa is an independent Rust reimplementation of the pi coding agent for the oxe engine.
It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by pi or its authors. oxa itself is
released under the MIT licence (see LICENSE).

oxa ports designs, formats, texts and some files from pi:

  Project:  pi (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi)
  Version:  pi 1.5.2
  Commit:   47e9d74f9186de37e700693fac0f6e56a499657a
  Licence:  MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner

Rule for the source tree: every oxa source file that ports a pi file starts with a
one-line comment `// ported from pi <path>` naming the pi path at the commit above.
Files copied without translation keep their content and are listed as "copied" below.

Ported designs and files (pi paths are relative to the pi repository root)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Agent loop
  packages/agent/src/agent-loop.ts, packages/agent/src/agent.ts, packages/agent/src/types.ts
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/agent-session.ts
  -> oxa-core (agent_loop, session, queue, retry)

Tool schemas, descriptions and behaviour
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/tools/{read,write,edit,bash,grep,find,ls}.ts
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/tools/{path-utils,file-mutation-queue,output-accumulator}.ts
  -> oxa-tools (descriptions.rs holds the texts and schemas)

edit-diff (matching, BOM / CRLF / mixed line endings, error texts)
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/tools/edit-diff.ts
  -> oxa-tools/src/{edit,diff}.rs

Truncation rules
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/tools/truncate.ts
  -> oxa-tools/src/shape.rs (adapted: one deterministic 16 KiB cap)

System prompt
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/system-prompt.ts, packages/coding-agent/src/core/skills.ts
  (formatSkillsForPrompt), packages/ai/src/utils/text.ts (getSystemMessageText)
  -> oxa-core/src/prompt.rs

Summary formats (compaction, branch summary, file lists, summary wrappers)
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/compaction/{compaction,branch-summarization,utils}.ts
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/messages.ts
  -> oxa-compact (prompt.rs holds the texts)

Session format v3
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/session-manager.ts, packages/coding-agent/src/migrations.ts
  packages/coding-agent/docs/session-format.md
  -> oxa-session

JSON and RPC protocol
  packages/coding-agent/src/modes/json-event.ts, packages/coding-agent/src/modes/print-mode.ts
  packages/coding-agent/src/modes/rpc/{rpc-mode,rpc-types,rpc-client,jsonl}.ts
  packages/coding-agent/docs/{json,rpc,rpc-commands,rpc-extension-ui}.md
  packages/coding-agent/examples/{rpc-client,rpc-extension-ui}.ts
  -> oxa-rpc

Keybinding ids and defaults
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/{keybindings,keybindings-schema,key-id-schema}.ts
  packages/tui/src/{keybindings,keys}.ts
  -> oxa-config/src/keybindings.rs, oxa-tui/src/keys.rs, oxa-proto/src/key.rs

Settings keys and defaults
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/{settings-schema,settings-defaults,settings-manager,settings-diagnostics}.ts
  -> oxa-config/src/{settings,schema}.rs

Theme schema and the two built-in themes
  packages/coding-agent/src/modes/interactive/theme/{theme-schema,theme-tokens,theme}.ts
  packages/coding-agent/src/modes/interactive/theme/dark.json   (copied)
  packages/coding-agent/src/modes/interactive/theme/light.json  (copied)
  -> oxa-tui/src/theme.rs

HTML export template (copied)
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/export-html/template.html      (copied)
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/export-html/template.css       (copied)
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/export-html/template.js        (copied)
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/export-html/{index,ansi-to-html,tool-renderer}.ts
  The template embeds third-party scripts from
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/export-html/vendor/ (highlight.min.js, marked.min.js,
  marked-cjk-friendly.min.js); these keep their own licences and notices.
  -> oxa-export

TUI component model (components render lines for a width; the renderer diffs lines)
  packages/tui/src/{tui,tui-main-screen,tui-alt-screen,terminal,stdin-buffer,utils}.ts
  packages/tui/src/{editor-component,kill-ring,undo-stack,word-navigation,autocomplete,fuzzy}.ts
  packages/tui/src/{terminal-image,terminal-colors,wheel-scroll,alt-screen-search}.ts
  packages/tui/src/components/*
  packages/coding-agent/src/modes/interactive/{interactive-mode,chat-viewport,tui-renderer,external-editor}.ts
  packages/coding-agent/src/modes/interactive/components/*
  -> oxa-tui, oxa-interactive

Extension API shape
  packages/coding-agent/src/core/extensions/{types,runner,loader,wrapper}.ts
  packages/coding-agent/docs/extensions.md
  -> oxa-ext (JavaScript in QuickJS; same API shape, `export default function (oxa)`)

Ported example extensions
  packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/plan-mode/
  packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/subagent/
  packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/{permission-gate,custom-compaction,todo,status-line}.ts
  packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/{tools,commands,input-transform,question,git-checkpoint,trigger-compact,protected-paths}.ts
  -> examples/extensions/, oxa-core/src/subagent.rs

Also ported by design: skills and prompt templates
  (packages/coding-agent/src/core/{skills,prompt-templates}.ts), project trust
  (packages/coding-agent/src/core/{project-trust,trust-manager}.ts), slash commands
  (packages/coding-agent/src/core/slash-commands.ts), codemode (packages/codemode/src/),
  the MCP client (packages/mcp/src/, packages/coding-agent/src/core/mcp-servers.ts), the
  package manager (packages/coding-agent/src/core/package-manager.ts), and the documentation
  pages under packages/coding-agent/docs/ that oxa's docs/ adapt.

